, at the initiation of BCX9930 dosing, participants were administered a dose of 200 mg BID for the first 14 days of treatment before increasing to 400 mg BID.\"},{\"id\":\"OG001\",\"title\":\"Placebo\",\"description\":\"Participants received BCX9930 matching placebo in double blind manner for 12 weeks (Part 1).\"}],\"denoms\":[{\"units\":\"Participants\",\"counts\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"10\"},{\"groupId\":\"OG001\",\"value\":\"2\"}]}],\"classes\":[{\"title\":\"Change at Week 12\",\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"-0.97\",\"spread\":\"1.706\"},{\"groupId\":\"OG001\",\"value\":\"0.80\",\"spread\":\"0.283\"}]}]},{\"title\":\"Baseline\",\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"1.66\",\"spread\":\"1.944\"},{\"groupId\":\"OG001\",\"value\":\"3.45\",\"spread\":\"2.475\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"SECONDARY\",\"title\":\"Part 1: Change From Baseline in Aspartate Aminotransferase (AST)\",\"populationDescription\":\"Participants in the ASaT population in Part 1 were analyzed.\",\"reportingStatus\":\"POSTED\",\"paramType\":\"MEAN\",\"dispersionType\":\"Standard Deviation\",\"unitOfMeasure\":\"Units per liter (U/L)\",\"timeFrame\":\"Baseline, Week 12\",\"groups\":[{\"id\":\"OG000\",\"title\":\"BCX9930\",\"description\":\"Participants received BCX9930 monotherapy in double blind manner (Part 1) for 12 weeks. Initially participants were to receive BCX9930 500 mg BID orally. Per protocol amendment, participants who previously received 500 mg BID and remained on study treatment were dose adjusted to 400 mg BID. For all newly enrolled participants, at the initiation of BCX9930 dosing, participants were administered a dose of 200 mg BID for the first 14 days of treatment before increasing to 400 mg BID.\"},{\"id\":\"OG001\",\"title\":\"Placebo\",\"description\":\"Participants received BCX9930 matching placebo in double blind manner for 12 weeks (Part 1).\"}],\"denoms\":[{\"units\":\"Participants\",\"counts\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"10\"},{\"groupId\":\"OG001\",\"value\":\"2\"}]}],\"classes\":[{\"title\":\"Baseline\",\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"107.43\",\"spread\":\"71.295\"},{\"groupId\":\"OG001\",\"value\":\"83.60\",\"spread\":\"6.505\"}]}]},{\"title\":\"Change at Week 12\",\"categories\":[{\"measurements\":[{\"groupId\":\"OG000\",\"value\":\"-68.83\",\"spread\":\"58.333\"},{\"groupId\":\"OG001\",\"value\":\"13.00\",\"spread\":\"36.487\"}]}]}]}]},\"adverseEventsModule\":{\"frequencyThreshold\":\"0\",\"timeFrame\":\"From Day 1 up to 408 days\",\"description\":\"The safety population included all participants who received at least 1 dose of study drug, whether placebo or BCX9930.\",\"eventGroups\":[{\"id\":\"EG000\",\"title\":\"BCX9930/BCX9930\",\"description\":\"Participants received BCX9930 monotherapy in double blind manner (Part 1) for 12 weeks, then in an open-label manner for the remainder of the study (Part 2). After the sponsor decided to halt enrolment in the study permanently and terminate the study, participants on blinded study treatment were switched to open-label BCX9930 prior to Week 12. Initially participants were to receive BCX9930 500 mg BID orally. Per protocol amendment, participants who previously received 500 mg BID and remained on study treatment were dose adjusted to 400 mg BID. For all newly enrolled participants, at the initiation of BCX9930 dosing, participants were administered a dose of 200 mg BID for the first 14 days of treatment before increasing to 400 mg BID. The maximum treatment duration was 378 days.\",\"deathsNumAffected\":0,\"deathsNumAtRisk\":10,\"seriousNumAffected\":5,\"seriousNumAtRisk\":10,\"otherNumAffected\":10,\"otherNumAtRisk\":10},{\"id\":\"EG001\",\"title\":\"Placebo\",\"description\":\"Participants received BCX9930 matching placebo in double blind manner for 12 weeks (Part 1).\",\"deathsNumAffected\":0,\"deathsNumAtRisk\":2,\"seriousNumAffected\":1,\"seriousNumAtRisk\":2,\"otherNumAffected\":2,\"otherNumAtRisk\":2},{\"id\":\"EG002\",\"title\":\"BCX9930 After Placebo\",\"description\":\"Participants who were initially randomized to placebo group received BCX9930 monotherapy in open label manner, if they had completed Week 12 on placebo, or earlier after the sponsor decided to halt enrolment in the study permanently and terminate the study. Initially participants were to receive BCX9930 500 mg BID orally. Per protocol amendment, participants who previously received 500 mg BID and remained on study treatment were dose adjusted to 400 mg BID. For all newly enrolled participants, at the initiation of BCX9930 dosing, participants were administered a dose of 200 mg BID for the first 14 days of treatment before increasing to 400 mg BID. The maximum treatment duration was 281 days.\",\"deathsNumAffected\":0,\"deathsNumAtRisk\":1,\"seriousNumAffected\":1,\"seriousNumAtRisk\":1,\"otherNumAffected\":1,\"otherNumAtRisk\":1}],\"seriousEvents\":[{\"term\":\"Enterovirus infection\",\"organSystem\":\"Infections and infestations\",\"sourceVocabulary\":\"MedDRA v24.0\",\"assessmentType\":\"SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numEvents\":0,\"numAffected\":0,\"numAtRisk\":10},{\"groupId\":\"EG001\",\"numEvents\":0,\"numAffected\":0,\"numAtRisk\":2},{\"groupId\":\"EG002\",\"numEvents\":1,\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":1}]},{\"term\":\"Influenza\",\"organSystem\":\"Infections and infestations\",\"sourceVocabulary\":\"MedDRA v24.0\",\"assessmentType\":\"SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numEvents\":1,\"numAffected\":1,\"numAtRisk\":10},{\"groupId\":\"EG001\",\"numEvents\":0,\"numAffected\":0,\"numAtRisk\":2},{\"groupId\":\"EG002\",\"numEvents\":0,\"numAffected\":0,\"numAtRisk\":1}]},{\"term\":\"Pneumonia fungal\",\"organSystem\":\"Infections and infestations\",\"sourceVocabulary\":\"MedDRA v24.0\",\"assessmentType\":\"SYSTEMATIC_ASSESSMENT\",\"stats\":[{\"groupId\":\"EG000\",\"numEvents\":1,\"numAffected\":